      "text": "Conforms with the requirements of EPUB Accessibility Specification 1.0 and WCAG level AA. <ProductFormFeatureDescription> may carry a URL linking to a compliance report or certification provided by an independent third party certifier. In the absence of a URL, conformance with the requirements of the Accessibility Specification is self-certified by the publisher. Alternatively, use codes 88–99 to provide extra details about certification"
